    <div class="prose">
      <p>Framed by the River Derwent and kunanyi / Mount Wellington, and shaped by the enduring culture and custodianship of the Palawa people, Tasmania's capital blends striking natural beauty with world class culture, exceptional food and wine, and a rich sense of history.</p>
      <p>From the sandstone charm of Salamanca to acclaimed galleries, waterfront dining and experiences just beyond the city, Hobart invites delegates to slow down, look closer and discover a destination full of character, contrast and possibility.</p>
      <p>It also rewards those who stay a little longer, with day trips, scenic adventures and uniquely Tasmanian experiences all within easy reach, making it easy to extend your visit and explore beyond the conference.</p>
